            "<p>Traditional</p>",
            "<p>n(n-1)/2 comparisons; more reliable than ranking</p>"
          ]
        },
        {
          "isHeader": false,
          "cells": [
            "<p>Forced Distribution (Bell Curve)</p>",
            "<p>Traditional</p>",
            "<p>Predefined percentages; prevents rating inflation; demotivating if misapplied</p>"
          ]
        },
        {
          "isHeader": false,
          "cells": [
            "<p>Graphic Rating Scale</p>",
            "<p>Traditional</p>",
            "<p>Traits rated on scale; simple; halo effect risk</p>"
          ]
        },
        {
          "isHeader": false,
          "cells": [
            "<p>Critical Incident Method</p>",
            "<p>Traditional</p>",
            "<p>Record exceptional good/bad behaviour; specific feedback; reduces recency bias</p>"
          ]
        },
        {
          "isHeader": false,
          "cells": [
            "<p>Essay Method</p>",
            "<p>Traditional</p>",
            "<p>Free-form; flexible; difficult to compare</p>"
