            "<p>Joint goal-setting; SMART objectives; most objective method; Peter Drucker</p>"
          ]
        },
        {
          "isHeader": false,
          "cells": [
            "<p>360-Degree Feedback</p>",
            "<p>Modern</p>",
            "<p>Multiple raters: self + peer + subordinate + superior + customer; holistic; development-focused</p>"
          ]
        },
        {
          "isHeader": false,
          "cells": [
            "<p>BARS</p>",
            "<p>Modern</p>",
            "<p>Behaviourally Anchored Rating Scale; behaviour-specific anchors; most accurate but complex</p>"
          ]
        },
        {
          "isHeader": false,
          "cells": [
            "<p>Assessment Centre</p>",
            "<p>Modern</p>",
            "<p>Multi-exercise, multi-assessor; predict management potential; selection + development</p>"
          ]
        },
        {
          "isHeader": false,
          "cells": [
            "<p>Balanced Scorecard</p>",
            "<p>Modern/Strategic</p>",
            "<p>4 perspectives; strategy-linked; Kaplan and Norton</p>"
          ]
        }
