      "content": "13.6 Mnemonics for Exam Preparation"
    },
    {
      "id": "itlxhxq",
      "type": "list",
      "items": [
        "Maslow's Hierarchy (bottom to top): Please See Something Every Sunrise → Physiological, Safety, Social, Esteem, Self-Actualisation",
        "Herzberg's Two Factors: SWAGS = Salary, Working conditions, Administration, Supervision = Hygiene Factors (not motivators); ARGA = Achievement, Recognition, Growth, Advancement = Motivators",
        "Kirkpatrick's 4 Levels: Reacting Learners Behave Responsibly → Reaction, Learning, Behaviour, Results",
        "Tuckman's Stages: Four Silly Naughty People Argue → Forming, Storming, Norming, Performing, Adjourning",
        "Kotter's 8 Steps: Usually Companies Vision Communicate Empowerment Starts Consolidating And → Urgency, Coalition, Vision, Communicate, Empower, Short-wins, Consolidate, Anchor",
        "Labour Codes (4 codes): Wages, Industrial Relations, Social Security, Occupational Safety → W-I-S-O",
        "Belbin's 9 Team Roles: Plants Raise Concerns; Shapes Monitor Teams; Implementers Complete Specialist Work → Plant, Resource Investigator, Coordinator, Shaper, Monitor Evaluator, Teamworker, Implementer, Completer Finisher, Specialist",
        "SHRM Harvard Model 4 Cs: Competence, Commitment, Congruence, Cost-effectiveness",
        "ADKAR Change Model: A person Desires Knowledge to be Able, Reinforced → Awareness, Desire, Knowledge, Ability, Reinforcement"
      ]
    },
    {
